{"words": [{"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "And those who"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "believe"}, {"text": "بِمَآ", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "أُنزِلَ", "translation": "(is) sent down"}, {"text": "إِلَيْكَ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "وَمَآ", "translation": "and what"}, {"text": "أُنزِلَ", "translation": "was sent down"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلِكَ", "translation": "before you"}, {"text": "وَبِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ", "translation": "and in the Hereafter"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "يُوقِنُونَ", "translation": "firmly believe"}], "sahih": "And who believe in what has been revealed to you, [O Muḥammad], and what was revealed before you, and of the Hereafter they are certain [in faith]."}